 "section_summary": "This section contains the cover, contents, and first 35 text pages of a July 1945 Foreign Economic Administration guide to administering production programs in occupied Japan. It describes Japan’s wartime economic controls and recommends how Military Government could use or reorganize them to direct scarce materials toward essential production. The guide notes that its recommendations were substantially completed before Japan’s surrender and require review against current U.S. policy.",
